information out there but as of  right now as i'm recording this it is on  his instagram page we have a little  hand-drawn picture of venom at the top  and then it says story by tom hardy and  kelly marcel written by kelly marcel now  if you were a fan of venom let there be  carnage you will be happy about this  because tom hardy and kelly marcel wrote  venom let there be carnage and now  they're both coming back and teaming up  to write venom 3. now what's really  interesting about this is that there's a  little hand drawn in red ink s on the  little hand-drawn venom face and we are  assuming that this can only mean one  thing spider-man as i mentioned tom  hardy has been teasing venom vs  spider-man for a very very long time now  since before venom let there be carnage  even came out when he was doing  interviews for the movie he teased that  the next thing and probably final thing  was going to be venom going up against  spider-man finally the sony verse for  venom kind of changed the whole origin  for venom how the symbiote got to earth  who it first attached to how eddie brock  bonded with the symbiote of course a lot  of people know that originally peter  parker aka spider-man was the first  person that the symbiote bonded to peter  parker eventually realized what the  symbiote was and that it was bad and got  rid of it in which the venom symbiote  then spent pretty much the rest of its  life mad at peter parker and trying to  get revenge on him he hated him for  rejecting him so it's kind of like i  love you but i hate you type of thing  but obviously since the first venom came  out we saw that the first person that  the symbiote bonded with was eddie brock  and we have not seen spider-man since  however the post-credits scene for venom  let there be carnage which was kind of a  slap to our face teased that eddie brock  and venom would be going up against the  mcu's tom hollands peter parker  everybody got really excited this is  what we were waiting for but 