and is going  to be a spider-man vs venom film but at  the same time venom 3 with tom hardy  looks to be a venom vs spider-man film  as well but since spider-man 4's venom  isn't going to be tom hardy that means  that venom 3 spider-man isn't going to  be tom holland and this is kind of a  bummer i think a lot of us were  expecting tom hardy's venom to go up  against tom hall and spider-man but it's  looking like that's not what we're going  to get however that does leave room for  a new spider-man in the sony spider-man  universe now since andrew garfield and  toby maguire return for spider-man noway  home this means that it could be one of  them however i'm gonna go ahead and rule  out toby mcguire at least not for the  main spider-man of that movie because  we've already had a venom movie with  tobey maguire spider-man i don't think  they would do that i don't think they'd  bring him back for another spider-man vs  venom movie and besides he does look  kind of older now however people really  really loved andrew garfield's  performance as spider-man in no way home  and we're very excited to see him back  and he did mention that he's open to  returning and we've heard from some  insiders that sony is considering using  andrew garfield for other projects in  the sony verse so it could be andrew  garfield spider-man that we're getting  for venom vs spider-man and after all we  did have that scene in spider-man no way  home where toby maguire talked about  fighting venom an alien and tom holland  talked about fighting an alien thanos  and andrew garfield had that line about  him wanting to fight an alien well looks  like he might get that opportunity in  venom three and of course there is  always the option that sony might get a  new spider-man altogether now at this  point in time i don't think this would  be a very good idea people really love  tom holland spider-man and of course the  mcu is going to continue to make  spider-man movies and like i said people  love the return of andrew garfield  spider-man so introducing an entirely  new spider-man probably would not be the  best idea i think the best idea at this  point would be to simply go with andrew  garfield toby mcguire got his venom  movie looks like tom holland's about to  get his venom movie in the mcu give  andrew garfield his venom movie going up  against tom hardy and venom three after  all it still is a venom movie tom  hardy's eddie brock should be the main  focus still but you should get an iconic  spider-man in there not just a  spider-man that nobody knows and is new  to the universe that's what i think they  should do and that's what i'm hoping  they do now there is one other piece to  this news today according to  thedirect.com  tom hardy did at one point post the  script to his instagram story that has  now been taken down but apparently when  it was up it had a sticker over it that  said last dance and if this is true if  that truly was on tom hardy's instagram  story in which they did take a  screenshot so if it's not photoshopped  that means that this is going to be the  last venom movie for tom hardy which is  sad to think about because again venom  is the best thing to come from sony's  universe and i think tom hardy is great  but let me know what you think about all  of this news in the comments down below  let me know who you would like to see  play spider-man in venom 3 going up  against tom hardy leave your thoughts  comments and theories down below don't  forget to like the video and subscribe  so you can stay up to date on all the  latest venom and spiderman news for live  updates you can follow me on instagram  and twitter and as always thank you all  so much for watching woof

